abstract: >
  This repository contains the research materials associated with a
  literature review on cancer survival prediction using machine learning
  and deep learning. The repository includes bibliographic records,
  screening data, structured data extraction, analysis resources,
  figures, tables, manuscript materials, and supplementary materials.

